Nerqova includes code and frozen evaluation manifests adapted from
Jared Palmer's Kev project (https://github.com/jaredpalmer/kev), Apache-2.0,
at commit 557598fced1dada75dfbf36ed144dce309ac6ceb.

The original copyright and license terms are preserved in LICENSE.

Nerqova's conditional-exit head weights were trained from frozen Kev suite
records and probability targets produced by the released Kev-4B checkpoint.
They do not redistribute the Kev or Qwen backbone weights.

Nerqova's packed Gated DeltaNet kernel and layer path adapt code from Apple's
MLX-LM project (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-lm), merge commit
e9308d7b0854105386a587db52c2f1a635196165, under the MIT license.
